      "uid": "zhcn:86c55336bcf75aa654e55e15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然叫『史上最快』这个名字，那么吃了之后\n我也一定能成为『史上最快』！　是吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58171c22224bcc3f1fe6534dc9459b592076266f6e469795fc9a247366c44e44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
