      "uid": "zhcn:608d4eb3a6225f0865e3ce09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就必须要吃了！　因为我是班长！\n作为大家的模范，应该成为比谁都快的马娘的存在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7903ab22649a44a20bba123b1ae88299368c1714f5fc3d6714f267828427b2fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
