      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看向队伍最前端――店前的牌子上，\n史上最快的前面还有『售罄记录』几个字……也就是说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da96a27bf13f160a97d5f11078d0c670b9f96ad5d621416ece910434d9a4262c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
